id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message (why*-style refusals included: Result<(), EngineError>); panic only on invariants (run_work_item's unknown hook, drain_work's step cap)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back (this slice only draws through sink.rng)
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state (scripts::script_of(state, def_id))
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only
card.args: &CardInstance (the caller's copy); reads and writes go to the card under that id in the state now
zone.readers: card_at -> Option<&CardInstance>, active_units_of -> Vec<&CardInstance>
sink.fields.wished: owed_behind: Option<IndexSet<String>> (cloned by reborrow), dispatched: Option<usize>
anon.args: TS inline object parameters as positional arguments in field order
